{"The `retryCount` update uses a stale in-memory value (`reminder.retryCount + 1`) instead of an atomic database increment. If two concurrent cron invocations process the same reminder, one increment is silently lost\u2014meaning the reminder may never reach the deletion threshold. Use Prisma's atomic `{ increment: 1 }` instead.": 0.9010593891143799, "The retry cleanup condition is missing an SMS method filter, so reminders from other workflow methods can be deleted when `retryCount > 1`.": 0.9466645121574402}